    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 196",
      "source_text": "1. شهادة القيد and وثيقة القيد are TWO different office artifacts",
      "source_text_sha256": "be581e2d90446758d955147fd8c5856961d75dc8840372ac88f48552e2222a5e",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 198",
      "source_text": "The Owner explicitly distinguishes the office Enrolment/Registration Certificate from the office Enrolment Document, says both are included together in applicable submissions, and repeatedly treats the office document itself as the thing whose governed fields trigger Committee adjudication.",
      "source_text_sha256": "1f28126acd544d7a57e9758be9378ecefe81439725096a4e915dd714a23452ab",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 213",
      "source_text": "These Committee transactions are not fundamentally project cases.",
      "source_text_sha256": "e90908b8cd626faffd2fc5ac389802932a45e21c1848166ad049ba55cdc934fd",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 221",
      "source_text": "subject_type = CONSULTANCY_OFFICE",
      "source_text_sha256": "062cf1a26f8817c330e273332a7b15f5031e16c8e19cb2920d1d8e85bb851bcf",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 232",
      "source_text": "For an Engineer Data Update, the engineer is the applicant/signatory on the engineer portion, while the office's Responsible Engineer signs/stamps the office-related regulatory material.",
      "source_text_sha256": "2593fa8939a115574799b6e81dc7a4e590282dba7fd73d7ea4207a5c7a223e10",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 235",
      "source_text": "the incoming RE is not yet accepted as the office's regulator-approved RE;",
      "source_text_sha256": "a5f4a12d1e7f6b820adb4950d6499d6e2fe79daaccbcecb1afbad387921e89ff",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 254",
      "source_text": "The actual form shown in the video—F-ECOC-10, Issue 01, issue date 2/2016—states requirements that the spoken discussion did not enumerate completely.",
      "source_text_sha256": "4ca8f83c27a180d2f98e380e4e7efec7461b5a28af1d2448157f09aaf2eeee3c",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 267",
      "source_text": "The Attached CD instruction must also be represented, but as a form-version-specific packaging requirement, not hard-coded forever.",
      "source_text_sha256": "544785bc64fdbc1f5ab062ef21b6a30443b4d9191ca2b196ba5f301ca4075299",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 281",
      "source_text": "The Owner is unusually explicit here: he does not want any Engineers Acceptance Committee paperwork leaving the office without his review because a seemingly trivial error can cost one or two weeks.",
      "source_text_sha256": "117c68a7dc3ff2a2c22427e90079ee8cc0d3d88717ba1b013795185542afa3bc",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 323",
      "source_text": "prepare complete packet → tell messenger which documents need which signers → messenger obtains signatures → package comes back → admin verifies signatures → office stamp applied → package dispatched/submitted.",
      "source_text_sha256": "e00d788fe4d9ecf4167c45839fd7f34d595ef6c78198df64fc8fb09418e5b2fb",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 344",
      "source_text": "The renewal form has a section explicitly marked For official use only, including an office-inspection field and remarks.",
      "source_text_sha256": "526882abaed7fb733ddac376e325bef6ffa49090953fc7b44b996be0e482a287",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 351",
      "source_text": "But if the returned government document contains a completed office-inspection result/comment, the app should capture it as external-authority evidence/outcome, not discard it.",
      "source_text_sha256": "5831c8383816a0d978570a443ca211195882d2301c7fdaf157adf65fde1af85f",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 355",
      "source_text": "The Owner describes an actual Committee return because AMEC left unused discipline fields blank rather than drawing the required dashes/marks to make it explicit that they were intentionally unused.",
      "source_text_sha256": "c23fef27d59d60c724e4c0fae6252b4a8dc5f4ef0c87ac4f9e7ef165d3dd6eae",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 365",
      "source_text": "The Owner keeps the original authority-stamped office document physically at the office. Copies/scans can be used for ordinary transactions.",
      "source_text_sha256": "d35d768945a1351f5427011852c912fae8e68eddefc711e6f48d4131a04cb286",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 366",
      "source_text": "The original leaves only when the office registration itself is being changed. The authority then takes/cancels/supersedes the old original and returns a new approved hard copy.",
      "source_text_sha256": "c59a3225a71aca21d970fa95ce94b1f486d819c11cc2da31a7942f7de0b250e1",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 402",
      "source_text": "The Owner says even an otherwise unrelated office-registration amendment can be rejected if the office currently lacks the required classified engineers.",
      "source_text_sha256": "551c339c4c58382e997b3ef0e8addc4079873d8bd15faf0f06161d237a2dc204",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 403",
      "source_text": "By contrast, the engineer Contact Data Update remains possible while the office is short, because that transaction is part of how AMEC cures the shortage.",
      "source_text_sha256": "414d74a91deb2f7f91ca2cb83f282c854216c290aa878122593ae1b77f63466f",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 418",
      "source_text": "Renewal requirement schemas are versioned.",
      "source_text_sha256": "fa12564e9ab548dbe0fd256f70774a8a9bbff3f910c3cc804487cdef679f2fe2",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 447",
      "source_text": "18. The “Attached CD” requirement should exist—but as versioned packaging metadata",
      "source_text_sha256": "a8a78ba797f45756872f74f5dce00aa0b094d519edd3c1a066b0cd114ee189f5",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 452",
      "source_text": "SubmissionPackagingRequirement",
      "source_text_sha256": "d468e8e4bd014f66456fd086ac2f20a4c7764478b059829d040de02ef85e49fc",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ATOMIC_REFINEMENT",
      "normative_source_sha256": "125619b91efdf80a5b76d08053ee242c929621334eda4f0c8b5f1fefb2504c4c",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source": "Source18",
      "source_locator": "paragraph 503",
      "source_text": "SPONSORSHIP_TRANSFER_PENDING → AMEC_SPONSORSHIP_CONFIRMED → ENGINEER_DATA_UPDATE_PREPARING → COUNTER_SUBMITTED → REGULATORY_EMPLOYER_UPDATED → UPDATED_CREDENTIAL_VERIFIED → OFFICE_ROSTER_ADD_PREPARING → ROSTER_ADD_SUBMITTED → REGULATOR_COUNTED",
      "source_text_sha256": "40e344c6fe9f488556584b421519f2b35e2ede82af9291fe7fe5ef9b56ceee61",
      "traceability_status": "SOURCE_BACKED"
    },
